) VALUES (
    'anterselva-antholz-venue-guide',
    '{"en": "Anterselva/Antholz: Italy''s Biathlon Paradise", "de": "Antholz: Italiens Biathlon-Paradies", "fr": "Anterselva/Antholz : Le paradis italien du biathlon", "it": "Anterselva: Il paradiso italiano del biathlon", "es": "Anterselva/Antholz: El paraíso italiano del biatlón", "pt": "Anterselva/Antholz: O paraíso italiano do biatlo", "nl": "Anterselva/Antholz: Italiës biathlon paradijs", "ar": "أنترسيلفا/أنتهولتز: جنة البياثلون الإيطالية", "ja": "アンテルセルバ/アントホルツ：イタリアのバイアスロン天国", "zh": "Anterselva/Antholz: Yidali de Dongji Liangxiang Tiantang", "ko": "안테르셀바/안톨츠: 이탈리아의 바이애슬론 천국"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "High in the South Tyrolean Alps, this world-class biathlon venue combines challenging trails with breathtaking scenery. A favorite among athletes and fans alike.", "de": "Hoch in den Südtiroler Alpen verbindet diese erstklassige Biathlon-Anlage anspruchsvolle Strecken mit atemberaubender Landschaft.", "fr": "Dans les Alpes du Tyrol du Sud, ce site de biathlon de classe mondiale combine des pistes exigeantes avec des paysages à couper le souffle.", "it": "In alto nelle Alpi dell''Alto Adige, questa sede di biathlon di classe mondiale combina piste impegnative con paesaggi mozzafiato.", "es": "En lo alto de los Alpes del Tirol del Sur, este lugar de biatlón de clase mundial combina senderos desafiantes con paisajes impresionantes.", "pt": "No alto dos Alpes do Tirol do Sul, este local de biatlo de classe mundial combina trilhas desafiadoras com paisagens de tirar o fôlego.", "nl": "Hoog in de Zuid-Tiroolse Alpen combineert deze wereldklasse biathlon locatie uitdagende paden met adembenemend landschap.", "ar": "في أعالي جبال الألب في جنوب تيرول، يجمع هذا الموقع العالمي للبياثلون بين المسارات الصعبة والمناظر الخلابة", "ja": "南チロルアルプスの高地にあるこの世界クラスのバイアスロン会場は、チャレンジングなコースと息をのむような景色を兼ね備えています。", "zh": "Zai Nantiluo''er Aerbisi gaochu, zhe ge shijie ji dongji liangxiang changguan jiehe le tiaozhanxing de saidao he lingren zhangmu jieshe de fengjing.", "ko": "남티롤 알프스 고지대에 위치한 이 세계적 수준의 바이애슬론 경기장은 도전적인 코스와 숨막히는 경치를 결합합니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Anterselva (Italian) or Antholz (German) has earned its reputation as one of the finest <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> venues in the world. Located in the South Tyrol region of northern Italy, this high-altitude arena offers perfect conditions for world-class competition.</p><h2>Location and Altitude</h2><p>The stadium sits at 1,600 meters elevation in the scenic Antholz Valley. The high altitude and reliable snow conditions make it an ideal venue for international biathlon events throughout the winter season.</p><p>The surrounding mountains create a natural amphitheater that enhances both the racing experience and spectator viewing.</p><h2>The Courses</h2><p>The biathlon courses at Anterselva challenge athletes with varied terrain that tests skiing ability and endurance. Technical climbs and fast descents keep racers on their toes, while the shooting range provides a dramatic focal point for fans.</p><p>Athletes like <a href=\"/dorothea-wierer-profile/\">Dorothea Wierer</a>, <a href=\"/lisa-vittozzi-profile/\">Lisa Vittozzi</a>, and <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Boe</a> have competed here in front of passionate crowds.</p><h2>The Stadium</h2><p>The arena features excellent viewing positions around the shooting range and along the course. Spectators can watch athletes arrive at the range, execute their shooting sequences, and ski away on the trails.</p><p>Large video screens throughout the venue help fans follow the action when athletes are on distant portions of the course.</p><h2>Atmosphere</h2><p>Italian biathlon fans are among the most enthusiastic in the world. The atmosphere at Anterselva, especially when Italian athletes are competing, creates an electric environment that athletes remember long after the races end.</p><h2>Getting There</h2><p>The venue is accessible from Innsbruck Airport (Austria) or Bolzano/Bozen in Italy. Winter driving requires appropriate preparation, though the region is well-equipped for winter tourism.</p><h2>South Tyrolean Culture</h2><p>The region offers a unique blend of Italian and Austrian culture, reflected in the bilingual signage and diverse cuisine. Visitors can enjoy traditional South Tyrolean specialties after watching world-class biathlon.</p>", "de": "<p>Antholz (Deutsch) oder Anterselva (Italienisch) hat sich den Ruf als einer der besten <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Biathlon</a>-Austragungsorte der Welt erworben. Im Südtirol in Norditalien gelegen, bietet diese Höhenlage-Arena perfekte Bedingungen.</p><h2>Lage und Höhe</h2><p>Das Stadion liegt auf 1.600 Metern Höhe im malerischen Antholzertal.</p><h2>Die Strecken</h2><p>Die Biathlon-Strecken in Antholz fordern Athleten mit abwechslungsreichem Terrain heraus.</p><p>Athleten wie <a href=\"/dorothea-wierer-profile/\">Dorothea Wierer</a> und <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Boe</a> sind hier angetreten.</p><h2>Atmosphäre</h2><p>Italienische Biathlon-Fans gehören zu den enthusiastischsten der Welt.</p>", "fr": "<p>Anterselva (italien) ou Antholz (allemand) a gagné sa réputation comme l''un des meilleurs sites de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> au monde. Situé dans la région du Tyrol du Sud au nord de l''Italie, cette arène d''altitude offre des conditions parfaites.</p><h2>Emplacement et altitude</h2><p>Le stade est situé à 1 600 mètres d''altitude dans la pittoresque vallée d''Antholz.</p><h2>Les parcours</h2><p>Des athlètes comme <a href=\"/dorothea-wierer-profile/\">Dorothea Wierer</a> et <a href=\"/lisa-vittozzi-profile/\">Lisa Vittozzi</a> ont concouru ici.</p><h2>Atmosphère</h2><p>Les fans italiens de biathlon sont parmi les plus enthousiastes au monde.</p>", "it": "<p>Anterselva (italiano) o Antholz (tedesco) ha guadagnato la sua reputazione come uno dei migliori siti di <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> al mondo. Situata nella regione dell''Alto Adige nel nord Italia, questa arena ad alta quota offre condizioni perfette.</p><h2>Posizione e altitudine</h2><p>Lo stadio si trova a 1.600 metri di altitudine nella pittoresca Valle di Anterselva.</p><h2>I percorsi</h2><p>Atleti come <a href=\"/dorothea-wierer-profile/\">Dorothea Wierer</a> e <a href=\"/lisa-vittozzi-profile/\">Lisa Vittozzi</a> hanno gareggiato qui.</p><h2>Atmosfera</h2><p>I fan italiani del biathlon sono tra i più entusiasti al mondo.</p>", "es": "<p>Anterselva (italiano) o Antholz (alemán) ha ganado su reputación como uno de los mejores lugares de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biatlón</a> del mundo. Ubicado en la región del Tirol del Sur en el norte de Italia, esta arena de gran altitud ofrece condiciones perfectas.</p><h2>Ubicación y altitud</h2><p>El estadio se encuentra a 1.600 metros de altitud en el pintoresco Valle de Antholz.</p><h2>Atmósfera</h2><p>Los fans italianos del biatlón están entre los más entusiastas del mundo.</p>", "pt": "<p>Anterselva (italiano) ou Antholz (alemão) ganhou sua reputação como um dos melhores locais de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biatlo</a> do mundo. Localizada na região do Tirol do Sul no norte da Itália, esta arena de alta altitude oferece condições perfeitas.</p><h2>Localização e altitude</h2><p>O estádio fica a 1.600 metros de altitude no pitoresco Vale de Antholz.</p>", "nl": "<p>Anterselva (Italiaans) of Antholz (Duits) heeft zijn reputatie verdiend als een van de beste <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> locaties ter wereld. Gelegen in de regio Zuid-Tirol in het noorden van Italië, biedt deze hooggelegen arena perfecte omstandigheden.</p><h2>Locatie en hoogte</h2><p>Het stadion ligt op 1.600 meter hoogte in de schilderachtige Antholz-vallei.</p>", "ar": "<p>اكتسبت أنترسيلفا (إيطالي) أو أنتهولتز (ألماني) سمعتها كواحد من أفضل مواقع <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">البياثلون</a> في العالم. تقع في منطقة جنوب تيرول شمال إيطاليا.</p><h2>الموقع والارتفاع</h2><p>يقع الملعب على ارتفاع 1600 متر في وادي أنتهولتز الخلاب.</p>", "ja": "<p>アンテルセルバ（イタリア語）またはアントホルツ（ドイツ語）は、世界最高の<a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">バイアスロン</a>会場の一つとしての評判を得ています。北イタリアの南チロル地方に位置し、この高地アリーナは完璧な条件を提供します。</p><h2>立地と標高</h2><p>スタジアムは風光明媚なアントホルツ渓谷の標高1,600メートルに位置しています。</p>", "zh": "<p>Anterselva (Yidaliyu) huo Antholz (Deyuyu) yi yingde shijie zuijia <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">dongji liangxiang</a> changguan zhiyi de shengyu. Weiyue Yidali beibude Nantiluo''er diqu, zhe ge gaohaiba jingji chang tigong wanmei de tiaojian.</p><h2>Weizhi he haiba</h2><p>Tiyuchang weiyue fengjing ruhua de Antholz shangu, haiba 1600 mi.</p>", "ko": "<p>안테르셀바(이탈리아어) 또는 안톨츠(독일어)는 세계 최고의 <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">바이애슬론</a> 경기장 중 하나로 명성을 얻었습니다. 북부 이탈리아의 남티롤 지역에 위치한 이 고지대 경기장은 완벽한 조건을 제공합니다.</p><h2>위치와 고도</h2><p>경기장은 그림 같은 안톨츠 계곡의 해발 1,600미터에 위치해 있습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'venue-guide',
    'BT',
    '{"en": "Anterselva/Antholz venue guide - World-class biathlon arena in the Italian South Tyrol Alps, home to exciting World Cup races and passionate fans.", "de": "Antholz Venue Guide - Erstklassige Biathlon-Arena in den Südtiroler Alpen.", "fr": "Guide du site Anterselva/Antholz - Arène de biathlon de classe mondiale dans les Alpes du Tyrol du Sud italien.", "it": "Guida alla sede Anterselva - Arena di biathlon di classe mondiale nelle Alpi dell''Alto Adige.", "es": "Guía del lugar Anterselva/Antholz - Arena de biatlón de clase mundial en los Alpes del Tirol del Sur italiano.", "pt": "Guia do local Anterselva/Antholz - Arena de biatlo de classe mundial nos Alpes do Tirol do Sul italiano.", "nl": "Anterselva/Antholz locatiegids - Wereldklasse biathlon arena in de Italiaanse Zuid-Tiroolse Alpen.", "ar": "دليل موقع أنترسيلفا/أنتهولتز - ملعب بياثلون عالمي في جبال الألب بجنوب تيرول الإيطالية", "ja": "アンテルセルバ/アントホルツ会場ガイド - イタリア南チロルアルプスの世界クラスのバイアスロンアリーナ", "zh": "Anterselva/Antholz changguan zhinan - Yidali Nantiluo''er Aerbisi de shijie ji dongji liangxiang jingji chang", "ko": "안테르셀바/안톨츠 경기장 가이드 - 이탈리아 남티롤 알프스의 세계적 수준의 바이애슬론 경기장"}'::jsonb,
